-## Step 6 — full judge run (paid; $10 approved in total)
-
-```bash
-EVAL_ALLOW_PAID_JUDGE=1 EVAL_JUDGE_BUDGET_USD=10 evaluation/.venv/bin/python -m evaluation.runners.run_eval --mode local --stage judge
